        "Planner confirmation observer0d217f65 accepts planner-c06-v1 only for fields=[summary], a valid period and zero materialDependencies. It is byte-identical in our W20 and inspected owner head.",
        "Consequently a callback that fabricates summary fails host equality; a callback that preserves the real field list fails the current Planner manifest. Wiring alone cannot complete the current path."
